{"path":"/2020/05/humuso-uzkandis-penktadienioreceptai.html","kind":"article","title":"Humuso užkandis (#PenktadienioReceptai)","description":"Ortodoksu tapau būdamas studentu. Tuomet laužiau galvą, ką per pasninkus gaminti valgyti. Kad kiti mažiau vargtų, pradedu pasninko receptų r...","published":"2020-05-15T20:02:00+03:00","section":"Tikėjimas ir kultūra","labels":["pasninkas","PenktadienioReceptai","receptai"],"hero":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200810075017im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-bjKy0Cbts7g/Xr7HB1dGJOI/AAAAAAAA6rQ/nA7EX0v0emIJtQUFF1m-Q2vHOA8cbn9WwCPcBGAsYHg/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/IMG_20200515_193042%257E2.jpg","html":"<i>Ortodoksu tapau būdamas studentu. Tuomet laužiau galvą, ką per pasninkus gaminti valgyti. Kad kiti mažiau vargtų, pradedu pasninko receptų rubriką. Savo receptais galite pasidalinti <u>sungaila.gintaras@gmail.com.</u></i><br>\n<i><br></i>\n<b>Humuso užkandis tinginiams<i>&nbsp;</i></b><br>\n<b><i><br></i></b>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-bjKy0Cbts7g/Xr7HB1dGJOI/AAAAAAAA6rQ/nA7EX0v0emIJtQUFF1m-Q2vHOA8cbn9WwCPcBGAsYHg/s1600/IMG_20200515_193042%257E2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20200810075017im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-bjKy0Cbts7g/Xr7HB1dGJOI/AAAAAAAA6rQ/nA7EX0v0emIJtQUFF1m-Q2vHOA8cbn9WwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20200515_193042%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<b><i><br></i></b>\nGreitas ir skanus pasninko užkandis.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Kaina</b>: Žema<br>\n<b>Laikas</b>: Greitai<br>\n<br>\nMums reikės:<br>\n* Pirktinio arba jau paruošto humuso (<a href=\"/2020/05/humusas-penktadienioreceptai.html\">receptas</a>)<br>\n* Bulvių<br>\n* Agurkų (ir kitų daržovių pagal skonį)<br>\n<br>\n1. Kepam bulves<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UYdWpC60AwQ/Xr7HUvbPklI/AAAAAAAA6rY/0diZ5PwlYdMZm8H1tP6yELIPwXx346jSACPcBGAsYHg/s1600/IMG_20200515_192755%257E2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20200810075017im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-UYdWpC60AwQ/Xr7HUvbPklI/AAAAAAAA6rY/0diZ5PwlYdMZm8H1tP6yELIPwXx346jSACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20200515_192755%257E2.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n2. Kol kepa, pjaustom agurkus griežinėliais<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MtKgwfU4pFI/Xr7HgG3qn0I/AAAAAAAA6rc/o1xV4u9zY60aO1vKD7BiksCh9tt3CjsQwCPcBGAsYHg/s1600/IMG_20200515_192849%257E2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20200810075017im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-MtKgwfU4pFI/Xr7HgG3qn0I/AAAAAAAA6rc/o1xV4u9zY60aO1vKD7BiksCh9tt3CjsQwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20200515_192849%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n3. Sudedame į lėkštę ir valgome. Agurkus valgydami merkiame į humusą. Pagal skonį, galima prisipjaustyti ir kitų daržovių.<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-prXMBvUM15c/Xr7IRtPLtII/AAAAAAAA6ro/zqW778FQrTAhMqztlL2LdQGiPSXg5p9kwCPcBGAsYHg/s1600/IMG_20200515_193055%257E2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20200810075017im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-prXMBvUM15c/Xr7IRtPLtII/AAAAAAAA6ro/zqW778FQrTAhMqztlL2LdQGiPSXg5p9kwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20200515_193055%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>\n<br>\n<br>","capture":"20200810075017","source":"http://www.ortodoksas.lt/2020/05/humuso-uzkandis-penktadienioreceptai.html"}
